// # LSP Scripts Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the 4 build entry points for the LSP server.
//
// Setup: Each script has a single purpose. They compose: build -> test -> verify -> release.
//
// Beats:
//   1. build.oo — compile the LSP server (wire + types + server + methods + symbols + bridge).
//   2. test.oo — run all 8 probe drivers in qa/.
//   3. verify.oo — parse VERSION, assert the api_surface field matches the 6-subdir count.
//   4. release.oo — build + test + verify + tarball output.

import "build.oo";
import "test.oo";
import "verify.oo";
import "release.oo";
